<title>UK: Bull ups five-year bond to 600 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Bull ups five-year bond to 600 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 600 million French francs from 500 million French francs, joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Societe Generale said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMPAGNIE DES MACHINES BULL</p>
<p> AMT    600 MLN FFR   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    22.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.34    PAY DATE    22.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.94     SPREAD	+65 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K)  5</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND MAR.02 BTAN AND NOV.02 OAT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
